WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.482
Microsoft To Do

00:00:01.293 --> 00:00:03.239
ends June 2027

00:00:03.774 --> 00:00:04.929
Microsoft To Do

00:00:05.083 --> 00:00:06.073
the free task

00:00:05.932 --> 00:00:07.005
and daily planning

00:00:06.816 --> 00:00:07.571
app used for

00:00:07.383 --> 00:00:08.184
the better part

00:00:07.996 --> 00:00:08.927
of nine years

00:00:09.116 --> 00:00:09.929
will go away

00:00:09.741 --> 00:00:12.582
forever on June 30, 2027

00:00:13.102 --> 00:00:16.569
Microsoft paid 100 to 200 million dollars

00:00:16.380 --> 00:00:18.620
in 2015 for Wunderlist

00:00:18.762 --> 00:00:19.387
the app that

00:00:19.199 --> 00:00:20.035
became To Do's

00:00:19.847 --> 00:00:20.436
core

00:00:20.637 --> 00:00:22.017
after shutting Wunderlist

00:00:21.828 --> 00:00:23.196
down in 2020

00:00:23.726 --> 00:00:24.634
The piece rounds

00:00:24.445 --> 00:00:25.624
up five replacement

00:00:25.436 --> 00:00:26.426
task apps for

00:00:26.309 --> 00:00:27.251
anyone who needs

00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:27.888
a new daily

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:28.560
planning tool

00:00:29.094 --> 00:00:30.108
Full story on

00:00:29.919 --> 00:00:30.815
the dashboard
